# Rule: Legacy tree

`legacy/**` is **archived** and not part of the TS build.

**Read first:** `sentinel/decisions/004-legacy-code-archival.md`

Do not “fix” paths or modernize in place without an explicit un-archive decision. Prefer copy-out patterns to active code.

**Process:** `sentinel/MAINTENANCE.md`
